      "id": "claim_b9e02695971f49988310b5ab59b2f43b",
      "statement": "evaluate_alert makes evaluation idempotent per scheduled tick via a conditional UPDATE of last_evaluated_at (only when null or older than the previous cron fire); the claim happens before the warehouse query, so a crash after the claim loses that tick's evaluation, and the task has max_retries=0.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/ddpui/celeryworkers/alert_tasks.py#L58-L94",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:58ec9a75aee6b5bc0dc06413ceda2982981038c249c8c628bca1ddc4a41432d7:"
