      "statement": "Alert messages are rendered with a regex-based {{token}} substitution (no Mustache sections or pystache dependency) using a closed per-alert-type token set; unknown or empty-valued tokens are left as raw {{token}}, and for kpi_rag current and target values are formatted through format_number_v2 using the KPI's extra_config.customizations.",
