    {
      "id": "claim_3ff039ad55ee40e59107351cd836900b",
      "statement": "The Alert model stores all three alert types in one table with FK to Metric/KPI using on_delete=CASCADE, JSON condition, standalone_config and recipients (orguser, external or user_group), a UTC schedule_cron, per-alert Slack webhook URL, and names unique per org; deleting a Metric or KPI therefore silently deletes its alerts and logs, while Metric.delete is blocked by charts/KPIs and KPI.metric is PROTECT.",
